@startuml
title Administrator Sequence Diagram

participant ":Administrator" as Admin
participant ":System" as System
participant ":Database" as Database

Admin -> System : Login(credentials)
System -> Database : Verify Credentials
Database --> System : Valid
System --> Admin : Login Successful

Admin -> System : View Bookings Dashboard
System -> Database : Retrieve Booking Statistics
Database --> System : Statistics Data
System --> Admin : Display Dashboard

Admin -> System : Track Food Wastage
System -> Database : Retrieve Consumption Data
Database --> System : Wastage Data
System --> Admin : Display Wastage Analysis

Admin -> System : Generate Reports
System -> Database : Fetch Analytics Data
Database --> System : Report Data
System --> Admin : Display Reports

Admin -> System : Manage Inventory
System -> Database : Update Inventory
Database --> System : Inventory Updated
System --> Admin : Inventory Update Successful

Admin -> System : Manage Menu
System -> Database : Update Menu
Database --> System : Menu Updated
System --> Admin : Menu Update Successful

Admin -> System : Logout
System --> Admin : Logged Out Successfully

destroy Admin

@enduml